<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech details capitalisation share award.</title>
<headline>Advtech details capitalisation share award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Technical Systems Ltd (Advtech) said on Friday it will create and issue &quot;N&quot; ordinary shares of 0.01 cent each by way of a capitalisation issue.</p>
<p>The new shares will carry reduced voting rights, it said.</p>
<p>Advtech shareholders will receive one &quot;N&quot; share for every 10 ordinary shares held on November 29, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
